    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d179">

                <pb facs="0244" n="142" xml:id="pg142"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">723.2515/380c: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of
                            State to the Ambassador in Brazil</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Morgan</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1918-12-21T16:00:00-05:00"><hi rendition="#italic">December 21,
                                1918, 4 p.m.</hi></date></dateline></opener>
                <p>What answer, if any, has Government of Brazil made to representations presented
                    by you as directed in Department’s December 4, 7 p.m.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Polk</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
